{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15210200","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210200","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1521020001:1":{"text":"真……真没想到，这么艰难的时候还能遇到好心人……！","source_cn":"真……真没想到，这么艰难的时候还能遇到好心人……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD54B76FD05A6903","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521020002:0":{"text":"是啊……自从饥荒和干旱开始，我家的东西就全都拿去换食物了。好久都没穿过这么温暖又厚实的衣服……","source_cn":"是啊……自从饥荒和干旱开始，我家的东西就全都拿去换食物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3CA19A9A9106D33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521020003:0":{"text":"这衣服不是很普通吗？我只是从库房里随便拿了几件。","source_cn":"这衣服不是很普通吗？我只是从库房里随便拿了几件。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F8A0A835AD24E68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521020004:0":{"text":"如果有很多人都需要的话，我应该可以给每个人都——","source_cn":"如果有很多人都需要的话，我应该可以给每个人都——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x670779E7D09923CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521020005:0":{"text":"……咳。","source_cn":"……咳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34B517AEBE0D72A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521020006:0":{"text":"你干嘛咳嗽？也感冒了吗？","source_cn":"你干嘛咳嗽？也感冒了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885EA8181A02BA1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521020007:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……<key:dialog100>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95CDD3EF7C0AB622","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521020008:0":{"text":"好孩子们，谢谢你们的好意。","source_cn":"好孩子们，谢谢你们的好意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1519BF910F3CA739","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521020009:0":{"text":"其实……我和我丈夫瓦罗已经在考虑要不要离开呼临城了。","source_cn":"其实……我和我丈夫瓦罗已经在考虑要不要离开呼临城了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F83153F5D479DF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521020010:0":{"text":"离开呼临城？为什么？！","source_cn":"离开呼临城？为什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB27F46B64A232E35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521020011:1":{"text":"这还用问吗？原因都摆在眼前了。","source_cn":"这还用问吗？原因都摆在眼前了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9315246E64D3B60C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521020012:1":{"text":"先是干旱、饥荒，又是战争、洪水……我们的房子早就变卖了，现在根本没有容身之所。","source_cn":"先是干旱、饥荒，又是战争、洪水……我们的房子早就变卖了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC50CB7ED93DC0620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521020013:0":{"text":"这还算是幸运的。至少在房子被冲塌之前，我们换来了一点口粮。","source_cn":"这还算是幸运的。至少在房子被冲塌之前，我们换来了一点口粮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x541CAACF24371A85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521020014:0":{"text":"还有我们的亲人……我们的孩子很早就被征召入伍。从那以后，我们就失去了他的消息……","source_cn":"还有我们的亲人……我们的孩子很早就被征召入伍。从那以后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF554AD20FCF418AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521020015:0":{"text":"也许他早已经不在人世了……","source_cn":"也许他早已经不在人世了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D5D6AAE4A61445C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521020016:0":{"text":"呼临城是个伤心地，我们早就该离开了。","source_cn":"呼临城是个伤心地，我们早就该离开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7E572D010DEDC48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521020017:0":{"text":"可是……可是离开呼临城以后，你们要去哪？","source_cn":"可是……可是离开呼临城以后，你们要去哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3D16B9700842DBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521020018:0":{"text":"离这里最近的是<style=\"highlight\">图塔镇</style>，你们要去那里吗？","source_cn":"离这里最近的是<style=highlight>图塔镇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DE068F92C2FE227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521020019:0":{"text":"图塔镇……？","source_cn":"图塔镇……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEAA8749A6B2E6DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521020020:0":{"text":"我听老师说，图塔镇好像也发生了天灾……那里的居民都很久不来呼临城做生意了。","source_cn":"我听老师说，图塔镇好像也发生了天灾……那里的居民都很久...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA028B9E921DCDD9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1521020021:0":{"text":"什么天灾！图塔镇那么虔诚地信仰丰饶神，怎么可能会遇到天灾？","source_cn":"什么天灾！图塔镇那么虔诚地信仰丰饶神，怎么可能会遇到天灾？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A00DB9FBAE07444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:152102