……","source_cn":"我……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD8A22398CEEA54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1521020027:0":{"text":"为什么呼临城的领主会是一个小孩？","source_cn":"为什么呼临城的领主会是一个小孩？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D87E81D571DC065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1521020028:1":{"text":"你们不喜欢他，为什么不换掉他？","source_cn":"你们不喜欢他，为什么不换掉他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D6B363F7A399222","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1521020029:0":{"text":"哼，谁让他是<style=\"highlight\">赫伦尼殿下</style>唯一的孩子！","source_cn":"哼，谁让他是<style=highlight>赫伦尼殿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EB5D3CDD33148E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:42:1521020029":{"text":"哼，谁让他是<style=\"highlight\">赫伦尼殿下</style>唯一的孩子！","source_cn":"哼，谁让他是<style=highlight>赫伦尼殿下</style>唯一的孩子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EB5D3CDD33148E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1521020030:0":{"text":"你们连赫伦尼殿下都不知道？！他是呼临城的前任领主，也是第一任领主！这座城邦就是他建立的！","source_cn":"你们连赫伦尼殿下都不知道？！他是呼临城的前任领主，也是...","status":"matched